test.yaml:25:19: "-k" disables the verification of the TLS certificate of the server, so the download can be replaced by anyone on the connection and nothing proves who sent it. remove "-k" and make the runner trust the certificate (for a private CA, "--cacert" of curl or "--ca-certificate" of wget) [unverified-download]
